       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose is unsafe as written.\n\n- **Daily total:** 2000 mg three times daily is 6,000 mg/day. The usual adult maximum is 4,000 mg/day, and many institutions cap it at 3,000 mg/day.\n- **Single dose:** 2,000 mg is twice the usual maximum single oral dose of 1,000 mg.\n- **Risk:** This could cause hepatotoxicity, even with normal liver function.\n\nHere are some common regimens that might be what you meant:\n- 1000 mg PO three times daily (3,000 mg/day)\n- 1000 mg PO four times daily (4,000 mg/day, the max)\n- 650 mg PO every 6 hours (2,600 mg/day)\n- 500 mg PO every 6 hours (2,000 mg/day)\n\nTell me which regimen you want, or confirm that you really meant 2000 mg three times daily. If you confirm, I'd need your rationale to put in the order note. I'll enter the order once you reply."
